+- Verification run
+  - RED: `go test ./internal/controlplane/store -run 'TestJobRepositoryTransition(RecordsEvent|RejectsInvalidWithStateCodeAndNoEvent)'` failed because `JobEventRepository` and transition metadata fields did not exist yet.
+  - `gofmt -w .`
